howl-report 2
profile el
verdict inconclusive
termination fixpoint
rounds 1
inconsistent false
omitted 3
omission DifferentIndividuals(http://example.org/t#a http://example.org/t#c)
omission NegativeObjectPropertyAssertion(http://example.org/t#r http://example.org/t#a http://example.org/t#c)
omission SameIndividual(http://example.org/t#a http://example.org/t#b)
unsatisfiable 0
subsumptions 1
sub http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
exit 2
